{"id":1526,"root":"قفل","bw":"qfl","tr":"q-f-l","found":true,"html":"<div class=\"lane-entry\">See Supplement </div><div class=\"lane-entry\"> <span class=\"lane-form\">  <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أَقْفَلَ البَابَ</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">*</span> </span> <em>He locked the door.</em> (TK.) See also <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أَغْلَقَ</span>. </div><div class=\"lane-entry\"> <span class=\"lane-form\"> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قَفْلٌ</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">*</span> </span>: see <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فَرَاشٌ</span>. </div><div class=\"lane-entry\"> <span class=\"lane-form\"> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قَافِلٌ</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">*</span> </span> A <em>slender</em> horse. (TA, art. <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خشب</span>.) </div><div class=\"lane-entry\"> <span class=\"lane-form\"> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قَافِلَةٌ</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">*</span> </span> <em>A company, or an assemblage of persons, travelling together:</em> (El-Fárábee, Msb:) or <em>a company returning from a journey:</em> (S, K:) and <em>commencing a journey;</em> as auguring their return: (El-Fárábee, Msb, K:) he who restricts it to those returning from a journey errs: (ElFárábee, Msb, in which see more:) <em>a caravan.</em> </div>","pages":null,"shownPages":null,"chars":986,"entries":5,"shownEntries":5,"truncated":false,"match":"direct","key":"qfl"}